    			    			        			<div class="card card-standard wide h-full">
        				        				<div class="card-body my-4">
        					<h3 class="card-title">KCKCC Students, Community Members Invited to Study Abroad in Italy</h3>
        					<div class="card-details">Registration is now open for Kansas City Kansas Community College’s 2027 Study Abroad trip to Italy taking place March 12 to 22, 2027.</div>
        				</div>
        				<div class="card-footer self-end">
        					<a class="cta-link" href="https://www.kckcc.edu/news//2026/10/kckcc-students-community-members-invited-to-study-abroad-in-italy.html">Continue Reading</a>
        				</div>
        			</div>
    			    		</div>
    		<div class="basis-1 lg:basis-1/2 flex flex-col gap-4 justify-between">
    			    			        			            			<div class="card card-standard wide">
            				<div class="card-body">
            					<h3 class="card-title text-primary">KCKCC to Host Fall Jazz Concerts</h3>
            					<div class="card-meta font-semibold"> Oct 01</div>
            					<div class="card-details truncate">Kansas City Kansas Community College (KCKCC) will showcase the talents of its student musicians during two free Fall Jazz Concerts Oct. 14 and 15 at the KCKCC Performing Arts Center. Both concerts begin at 7 p.m. and are free and open to the public.</div>
            						</div>
            					<div class="card-footer">
            						<a class="cta-link" href="https://www.kckcc.edu/news//2026/10/kckcc-to-host-fall-jazz-concerts.html">Continue Reading</a>
            					</div>
            					            			
            			</div>
            			        			    			        			            			<div class="card card-standard wide">
            				<div class="card-body">
            					<h3 class="card-title text-primary">KCKCC to Host Community Health Fair</h3>
            					<div class="card-meta font-semibold"> Sep 29</div>
            					<div class="card-details truncate">Kansas City Kansas Community College is hosting a Community Health Fair from 9 a.m. to 2 p.m. Oct. 7 on the KCKCC Main Campus, 7250 State Ave. The fair is open to everyone and free to attend.</div>
            						</div>
            					<div class="card-footer">
            						<a class="cta-link" href="https://www.kckcc.edu/news//2026/09/kckcc-to-host-community-health-fair.html">Continue Reading</a>
            					</div>
            					            			
            			</div>
            			        			    			        			            			<div class="card card-standard wide">
            				<div class="card-body">
            					<h3 class="card-title text-primary">KCKCC Jazz Showcase Set for Oct. 1</h3>
            					<div class="card-meta font-semibold"> Sep 28</div>
            					<div class="card-details truncate">Kansas City Kansas Community College (KCKCC) will showcase the talents of its student musicians during the KCKCC Jazz Showcase from 6 to 9 p.m. Oct. 1 at 515 Music Hub, 515 Southwest Blvd. in Kansas City, Mo.</div>
            						</div>
            					<div class="card-footer">
            						<a class="cta-link" href="https://www.kckcc.edu/news//2026/09/kckcc-jazz-showcase-set-for-oct-1.html">Continue Reading</a>
            					</div>
            					            			
            			</div>
            			        			    			    		</div>
